WEBVTT

00:06:25.846 --> 00:06:30.101
na kuitikia nafasi tunayopewa.

00:06:30.101 --> 00:06:32.476
Sio mbaya kama inavyoonekana.

00:06:32.476 --> 00:06:36.369
Kiukweli,unapoiangalia na kuizoea,

00:06:36.369 --> 00:06:40.447
unakuta muda mwingi,tunachopewa

00:06:40.447 --> 00:06:42.822
ni nafasi ya kustarehe,

00:06:42.822 --> 00:06:44.789
na tunaikosa kwa sababu

00:06:44.789 --> 00:06:46.052
tunaharakisha maisha

00:06:46.052 --> 00:06:49.919
na hatuachi kuona nafasi.

00:06:49.919 --> 00:06:51.350
Lakini wakati huo,

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:54.296
tunapewa kitu kigumu,

00:06:54.296 --> 00:06:58.277
na hiki kitu kigumu kinapokuja,

00:06:58.277 --> 00:07:02.715
ni changamoto katika kuifanikisha ile nafasi,